  "description": "WUHGEM crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C54 H56 Dy3 N21 O14 Zn2,3.3(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 4 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 2 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 2 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.528-3.650 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.37-108.55°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Zn2Dy3(m-salen)3(N3)5(OH)2]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
